how it works->
1. User visits property
         User opens property page
        Clicks “I’m Interested”
        Fills form

👉 Backend action

       Create Lead
       Assign:
       assignedTo = req.user._id (if agent logged in) OR auto-assign logic
       Create Activity:
        Lead Created
        Auto Follow-up (Call in 1 day)
        
        
2. Lead Created (Status = "New")
           Visible in Leads Dashboard
           Visible in Follow-ups (Activity)

3. Agent contacts lead
         Agent clicks:
      📞 Call OR ✉ Email

👉 Backend

      Update lead status → "Contacted"
      Create Activity:
    "Agent contacted lead"
     4. Qualification Stage

   Agent decides:

   ✅ If Interested → Qualified
     Update lead → "Qualified"


     Create Client
     Create Deal
         Lead → Qualified → (Auto create)
                         → Client
                         → Deal

   👉 Also create Activity:

"    Lead converted to Client & Deal"
   ❌ If Not Interested → Lost
     Update lead → "Lost"

   👉 Activity:
    "Lead marked as Lost"
  
  
5. Client Management

 Now agent works from:

      Client Profile
                 Can:
                 Add interactions
                Add follow-ups
                Track history


6. Deal Pipeline

        Deal goes through stages like:

        Negotiation
        Agreement
       Finalization
   
👉 Each step:

    Updates deal stage
     Logs Activity


7. Closing
     /✅ If success:
     Deal → "Closed"
     Lead → "Closed"
     ❌ If failed:
    Deal → "Lost"
    Lead → "Lost"




